==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~50 seconds<sup>600f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 1) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 1)]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 1) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 1)]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Li'l Gau (form 1) (Enemy)|Li'l Gaus (form 1)]] spawn, delay 0.07~1 seconds<sup>2f~30f</sup>.
**1 [[Kerihime (form 1) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 1)]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. It's also insanely easy to cheese. Princess Punt is very easy to defeat and you should focus on the Li'l Gaus.

